{"id":"CYfcUSvScrHdwrVq","meta":{"instanceId":"c2650793f644091dc80fb900fe63448ad1f4b774008de9608064d67294f8307c"},"name":"dispatch snow and ice crews from the weather forecast","tags":[],"nodes":[{"id":"sticky-note","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-496,-1984],"parameters":{"width":512,"height":1028,"content":"## 09-13-01 dispatch snow and ice crews from the weather forecast\n\n### How it works\n\nEvery three hours, or when you hit the manual check webhook, the workflow reads your site list from Google Sheets and pulls a two day Open-Meteo forecast for every property. Rows missing an id, coordinates, a trigger or a contact email are rejected to the admin inbox, Telegram and the Errors tab, so bad rows are never checked.\n\nA rules node compares the next 12 hours of snowfall, freezing rain and temperature against each site's own trigger. Sites that cross it go into one AI pass that writes a crew brief, a storm summary and a short client notice per site. Each dispatch is logged, emailed to the crew lead, emailed to the property contact and posted to Telegram.\n\nYour crew marks a site clear on the confirmation webhook: the dispatch row is updated with the time to clear and the salt used, the client gets a completion notice and the owner gets a Telegram confirmation. A daily sweep finds dispatches still open after six hours and nudges you, or reports that every site is confirmed.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Create a Google Sheets workbook with four tabs: Sites, DispatchLog, CheckLog and Errors.\n- Add each property with its coordinates, priority, snow trigger in cm, ice flag, crew email and contact email.\n- Connect Google Sheets, Gmail, Telegram and an OpenAI compatible chat model, then set the crew, admin and owner addresses.\n\n### Customization\n\n- Change the poll interval, the 12 hour look ahead and the six hour follow up window.\n- Edit the assistant system message to match your own dispatch language and service promises."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-triggers","name":"Sticky Note: Triggers","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[112,-1360],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1292,"height":416,"content":"## Triggers\n\nA three hourly poll and a manual check webhook run the forecast sweep. A crew confirmation webhook closes dispatches. A daily sweep and a manual run check the open ones."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-forecast-check-a","name":"Sticky Note: Forecast check and rule engine","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[96,-912],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1880,"height":400,"content":"## Forecast check and rule engine\n\nEach site gets its own Open-Meteo forecast. The rules node compares the next 12 hours of snow, rain and temperature against that site's trigger."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-dispatch,-crew-b","name":"Sticky Note: Dispatch, crew brief and client notice","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2000,-912],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1624,"height":400,"content":"## Dispatch, crew brief and client notice\n\nThe AI pass writes a crew brief, a storm summary and a client notice per site. Then the dispatch row, the crew email, the client email and the owner Telegram alert."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-rejected-site-ro","name":"Sticky Note: Rejected site rows","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[992,-480],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":976,"height":304,"content":"## Rejected site rows\n\nA row with no site id, coordinates, trigger or contact email is never checked. It goes to the admin inbox, the Telegram alert and the Errors tab."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-check-log","name":"Sticky Note: Check log","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[2000,-464],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":564,"height":288,"content":"## Check log\n\nEvery sweep writes one row with the sites checked, the dispatches raised, the no action count and the rejected count."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-crew-confirmatio","name":"Sticky Note: Crew confirmation","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[1440,-1360],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1676,"height":416,"content":"## Crew confirmation\n\nThe crew webhook matches the dispatch row, updates the outcome, emails the client a completion notice and tells the owner on Telegram."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-bad-or-unknown-d","name":"Sticky Note: Bad or unknown dispatch","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[3136,-1360],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":780,"height":416,"content":"## Bad or unknown dispatch\n\nA confirmation with a missing or unknown dispatch id is reported to the admin by email and Telegram instead of updating the wrong row."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"sticky-note-unconfirmed-disp","name":"Sticky Note: Unconfirmed dispatches","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[544,-1760],"parameters":{"color":7,"width":1740,"height":352,"content":"## Unconfirmed dispatches\n\nThe daily sweep finds dispatches open for more than six hours and nudges the owner by email and Telegram, or reports that everything is confirmed."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"poll-weather-every-3-hours","name":"Poll Weather Every 3 Hours","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[160,-768],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"cronExpression","expression":"0 */3 * * *"}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"run-weather-check-now","name":"Run Weather Check Now","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[240,-1200],"webhookId":"634fc529-4a46-4909-b1b0-748d27367620","parameters":{"path":"snow/check","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"crew-marks-site-done","name":"Crew Marks Site Done","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[480,-1200],"webhookId":"0f8f8536-faff-4986-8c78-9bd5f095a59c","parameters":{"path":"snow/confirm","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"run-dispatch-follow-up-now","name":"Run Dispatch Follow Up Now","type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","position":[720,-1200],"webhookId":"5230bcc1-25a6-4e64-8518-e27c26d43e94","parameters":{"path":"snow/followup","options":{},"httpMethod":"POST"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"daily-unconfirmed-dispatch-s","name":"Daily Unconfirmed Dispatch Sweep","type":"n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger","position":[608,-1616],"parameters":{"rule":{"interval":[{"field":"cronExpression","expression":"0 7 * * *"}]}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"read-site-registry","name":"Read Site Registry","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[352,-768],"parameters":{"options":{},"sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Sites"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"1uy_a0M6kTCbzQI3k8p0tYwAyagaDBSTCeXLpM7UQk1w"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Feedback Analyzer Sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.6},{"id":"validate-site-rows","name":"Validate Site Rows","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[592,-768],"parameters":{"jsCode":"\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const r = item.json || {};\n  const lat = Number(r.lat);\n  const lon = Number(r.lon);\n  const trig = Number(r.trigger_cm);\n  const activeRaw = String(r.active || 'yes').toLowerCase().trim();\n  const active = !(activeRaw === 'no' || activeRaw === 'false' || activeRaw === '0');\n  const problems = [];\n  if (!String(r.site_id || '').trim()) problems.push('site_id');\n  if (!String(r.site_name || '').trim()) problems.push('site_name');\n  if (!isFinite(lat) || lat < -90 || lat > 90) problems.push('lat');\n  if (!isFinite(lon) || lon < -180 || lon > 180) problems.push('lon');\n  if (!isFinite(trig) || trig < 0) problems.push('trigger_cm');\n  if (String(r.crew_email || '').indexOf('@') < 0) problems.push('crew_email');\n  if (String(r.contact_email || '').indexOf('@') < 0) problems.push('contact_email');\n  if (!active) problems.push('inactive');\n  out.push({ json: {\n    site_id: String(r.site_id || '').trim(),\n    site_name: String(r.site_name || '').trim(),\n    address: String(r.address || '').trim(),\n    lat: lat,\n    lon: lon,\n    priority: Number(r.priority || 3),\n    trigger_cm: trig,\n    ice_risk: String(r.ice_risk || 'yes').toLowerCase().trim().indexOf('no') !== 0,\n    crew_name: String(r.crew_name || '').trim(),\n    crew_email: String(r.crew_email || '').trim(),\n    contact_name: String(r.contact_name || '').trim(),\n    contact_email: String(r.contact_email || '').trim(),\n    valid: problems.length === 0,\n    invalid_reason: problems.length ? ('missing or invalid: ' + problems.join(', ')) : ''\n  } });\n}\nreturn out;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"site-row-valid","name":"Site Row Valid?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[832,-768],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.valid }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"build-invalid-site-alert","name":"Build Invalid Site Alert","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","position":[1056,-368],"parameters":{"options":{},"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"a0","name":"error_id","type":"string","value":"={{ 'ER-' + Date.now() }}"},{"id":"a1","name":"source","type":"string","value":"site registry"},{"id":"a2","name":"site_id","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.site_id || 'unknown site' }}"},{"id":"a3","name":"reason","type":"string","value":"={{ $json.invalid_reason }}"},{"id":"a4","name":"logged_at","type":"string","value":"={{ $now.toISO() }}"},{"id":"a5","name":"tg_text","type":"string","value":"={{ 'Site row rejected: ' + ($json.site_id || 'no id') + ' (' + ($json.site_name || 'no name') + ') | ' + $json.invalid_reason + ' | fix the row in the Sites tab' }}"},{"id":"a6","name":"email_subject","type":"string","value":"={{ 'Site row rejected: ' + ($json.site_id || 'no id') }}"},{"id":"a7","name":"email_body","type":"string","value":"={{ 'This row in the Sites tab was not checked because it is incomplete.<br><br>Site id: ' + ($json.site_id || 'missing') + '<br>Site name: ' + ($json.site_name || 'missing') + '<br>Problem: ' + $json.invalid_reason + '<br><br>Fix the row and the next sweep will pick it up.' }}"}]}},"typeVersion":3.4},{"id":"alert-invalid-site-on-telegr","name":"Alert Invalid Site On Telegram","type":"n8n-nodes-base.telegram","position":[1296,-368],"webhookId":"54dc0f12-41b5-497d-859b-8a942dfe6c4b","parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.tg_text }}","chatId":"123456789","additionalFields":{}},"credentials":{"telegramApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"CF Openai Bot"}},"typeVersion":1.2},{"id":"email-site-admin-about-inval","name":"Email Site Admin About Invalid Row","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","position":[1536,-368],"webhookId":"dd3b1547-6c19-42c1-9d77-64711a84ebb6","parameters":{"sendTo":"user@example.com","message":"={{ $json.email_body }}","options":{},"subject":"={{ $json.email_subject }}"},"credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Gmail Fresh Sep05"}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"log-site-error","name":"Log Site Error","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1776,-368],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"reason":"={{ $json.reason }}","source":"={{ $json.source }}","site_id":"={{ $json.site_id }}","error_id":"={{ $json.error_id }}","logged_at":"={{ $json.logged_at }}"},"schema":[{"id":"error_id","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"error_id","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"source","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"source","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"site_id","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"site_id","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"reason","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"reason","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"logged_at","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"logged_at","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"Errors"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"1uy_a0M6kTCbzQI3k8p0tYwAyagaDBSTCeXLpM7UQk1w"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Feedback Analyzer Sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.6},{"id":"fetch-site-forecast","name":"Fetch Site Forecast","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","position":[1072,-768],"parameters":{"url":"=https://api.open-meteo.com/v1/forecast?latitude={{ $json.lat }}&longitude={{ $json.lon }}&hourly=snowfall,temperature_2m,precipitation,wind_speed_10m&forecast_days=2&timezone=auto","options":{}},"typeVersion":4.2},{"id":"evaluate-dispatch-rules","name":"Evaluate Dispatch Rules","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1312,-752],"parameters":{"jsCode":"\nconst sites = $('Validate Site Rows').all().map(i => i.json).filter(s => s.valid);\nconst out = [];\n$input.all().forEach((item, k) => {\n  const site = sites[k] || {};\n  const f = item.json || {};\n  const h = f.hourly || {};\n  const off = Number(f.utc_offset_seconds || 0);\n  const nowLocal = new Date(Date.now() + off * 1000).toISOString().slice(0, 16);\n  const times = h.time || [];\n  let start = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < times.length; i++) {\n    if (String(times[i]).slice(0, 16) >= nowLocal) { start = i; break; }\n  }\n  const end = Math.min(start + 12, times.length);\n  const snow = (h.snowfall || []).slice(start, end).map(Number);\n  const temp = (h.temperature_2m || []).slice(start, end).map(Number);\n  const prec = (h.precipitation || []).slice(start, end).map(Number);\n  const wind = (h.wind_speed_10m || []).slice(start, end).map(Number);\n  const sum = a => a.reduce((x, y) => x + (isFinite(y) ? y : 0), 0);\n  const snowCm = Math.round(sum(snow) * 100) / 100;\n  const precipMm = Math.round(sum(prec) * 100) / 100;\n  const minTemp = temp.length ? Math.min.apply(null, temp) : 99;\n  const maxWind = wind.length ? Math.max.apply(null, wind) : 0;\n  const trig = Number(site.trigger_cm || 0);\n  const snowHit = snowCm >= trig;\n  const iceHit = site.ice_risk === true && minTemp <= 0 && precipMm >= 0.2;\n  const needs = snowHit || iceHit;\n  let reason = 'no trigger met in the next 12 hours';\n  if (snowHit && iceHit) reason = 'forecast snow ' + snowCm + ' cm and freezing precipitation near ' + Math.round(minTemp) + ' C';\n  else if (snowHit) reason = 'forecast snow ' + snowCm + ' cm at or above the ' + trig + ' cm trigger';\n  else if (iceHit) reason = 'freezing precipitation near ' + Math.round(minTemp) + ' C with ' + precipMm + ' mm of moisture';\n  let firstSnow = -1;\n  for (let i = 0; i < snow.length; i++) { if (snow[i] > 0) { firstSnow = i; break; } }\n  const severity = (Number(site.priority || 3) === 1 || (trig > 0 && snowCm >= trig * 2)) ? 'high' : 'normal';\n  out.push({ json: Object.assign({}, site, {\n    forecast_snow_cm: snowCm,\n    forecast_precip_mm: precipMm,\n    forecast_min_temp_c: Math.round(minTemp * 10) / 10,\n    forecast_max_wind_kmh: Math.round(maxWind),\n    forecast_window: String(times[start] || '') + ' to ' + String(times[Math.max(start, end - 1)] || '') + ' local',\n    snow_start_offset_hours: firstSnow < 0 ? 0 : firstSnow,\n    trigger_reason: reason,\n    needs_dispatch: needs,\n    severity: severity,\n    checked_at: $now.toISO()\n  }) });\n});\nreturn out;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"build-check-log-row","name":"Build Check Log Row","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2096,-352],"parameters":{"jsCode":"\nconst rows = $('Validate Site Rows').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst evals = $('Evaluate Dispatch Rules').all().map(i => i.json);\nconst invalid = rows.filter(r => !r.valid);\nconst disp = evals.filter(e => e.needs_dispatch);\nconst lines = disp.map(e => e.site_name + ' (priority ' + e.priority + '): ' + e.trigger_reason);\nreturn [{ json: {\n  check_id: 'CHK-' + $now.toFormat('yyyyLLdd-HHmmss'),\n  run_at: $now.toISO(),\n  sites_checked: rows.length,\n  dispatch_count: disp.length,\n  no_action_count: evals.length - disp.length,\n  invalid_count: invalid.length,\n  summary: disp.length ? ('Dispatched: ' + lines.join(' ;; ')) : 'No site crossed its trigger on this check'\n} }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"append-check-log","name":"Append Check Log","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2336,-352],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"run_at":"={{ $json.run_at }}","summary":"={{ $json.summary }}","check_id":"={{ $json.check_id }}","invalid_count":"={{ $json.invalid_count }}","sites_checked":"={{ $json.sites_checked }}","dispatch_count":"={{ $json.dispatch_count }}","no_action_count":"={{ $json.no_action_count }}"},"schema":[{"id":"check_id","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"check_id","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"run_at","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"run_at","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"sites_checked","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"sites_checked","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"dispatch_count","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"dispatch_count","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"no_action_count","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"no_action_count","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"invalid_count","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"invalid_count","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"summary","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"summary","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"defineBelow","matchingColumns":[]},"options":{},"operation":"append","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"name","value":"CheckLog"},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"1uy_a0M6kTCbzQI3k8p0tYwAyagaDBSTCeXLpM7UQk1w"}},"credentials":{"googleSheetsOAuth2Api":{"id":"credential-id","name":"Feedback Analyzer Sheets"}},"typeVersion":4.6},{"id":"dispatch-needed","name":"Dispatch Needed?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1552,-752],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"loose"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"c1","operator":{"type":"boolean","operation":"true"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.needs_dispatch }}","rightValue":""}]}},"typeVersion":2.3},{"id":"no-dispatch-needed","name":"No Dispatch Needed","type":"n8n-nodes-base.noOp","position":[1792,-656],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"combine-dispatch-sites","name":"Combine Dispatch Sites","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1792,-832],"parameters":{"jsCode":"\nconst items = $input.all().map(i => i.json);\nconst lines = items.map(s => s.site_id + ' | ' + s.site_name + ' | ' + s.address + ' | priority ' + s.priority\n  + ' | trigger: ' + s.trigger_reason + ' | snow ' + s.forecast_snow_cm + ' cm | min temp ' + s.forecast_min_temp_c\n  + ' C | wind ' + s.forecast_max_wind_kmh + ' km/h | window ' + s.forecast_window + ' | crew ' + s.crew_name\n  + ' (' + s.crew_email + ') | contact ' + s.contact_name + ' (' + s.contact_email + ')');\nreturn [{ json: { site_count: items.length, sites: items, dispatch_request: lines.join(String.fromCharCode(10)) } }];\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"write-dispatch-briefs","name":"Write Dispatch Briefs","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","position":[2032,-768],"parameters":{"text":"={{ $json.dispatch_request }}","options":{"systemMessage":"You are the dispatch assistant for a winter maintenance contractor that clears snow and ice from commercial properties. You receive the sites that crossed their own snow or ice trigger, with the forecast numbers from the next 12 hours. Write one dispatch pack per site. Return ONLY valid JSON: {\"briefs\":[{\"site_id\":\"...\",\"storm_summary\":\"...\",\"crew_brief\":\"...\",\"client_notice\":\"...\"}]} with exactly one entry per site, in the same order. storm_summary: under 40 words on what the storm does to that site. crew_brief: under 90 words, plain text, no markdown, names the site, the priority, the trigger that fired, whether to plow, salt or both, what to watch (ramps, hydrants, pedestrian routes) and the order to work if several sites are listed. client_notice: under 60 words, warm and plain, tells the property contact that a crew is being dispatched, what will be done and when they will hear next. Use only the figures given, never invent numbers, no emojis, JSON only."},"promptType":"define"},"typeVersion":3.1},{"id":"dispatch-brief-model","name":"Dispatch Brief Model","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi","position":[2288,-656],"parameters":{"model":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"gpt-4o-mini","cachedResultName":"gpt-4o-mini"},"options":{},"builtInTools":{}},"credentials":{"openAiApi":{"id":"credential-id","name":"jonathan"}},"typeVersion":1.3},{"id":"split-dispatch-briefs","name":"Split Dispatch Briefs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[2400,-768],"parameters":{"jsCode":"\nconst evals = $('Evaluate Dispatch Rules').all().map(i => i.json).filter(e => e.needs_dispatch);\nconst s = String($json.output || '');\nconst i = s.indexOf('{');\nconst j = s.lastIndexOf('}');\nlet p = {};\ntry { p = JSON.parse(s.slice(i, j + 1)); } catch (e) { p = {}; }\nlet briefs = Array.isArray(p.briefs) ? p.briefs : [];\nif (!briefs.length && (p.crew_brief || p.client_notice)) briefs = [p];\nconst stamp = $now.toFormat('yyyyLLdd-HHmmss');\nconst out = [];\nbriefs.forEach(b => {\n  const sid = String((b && b.site_id) || '').trim();\n  let site = evals.filter(e => String(e.site_id) === sid)[0];\n  if (!site) site = evals.filter(e => out.every(o => o.json.site_id !== e.site_id))[0];\n  if (!site) return;\n  const nl = String.fromCharCode(10);\n  const toHtml = t => String(t || '').split(nl).join('<br>');\n  out.push({ json: {\n    dispatch_id: 'DSP-' + site.site_id + '-' + stamp,\n    site_id: site.site_id,\n    site_name: site.site_name,\n    address: site.address,\n    priority: site.priority,\n    trigger_reason: site.trigger_reason,\n    forecast_snow_cm: site.forecast_snow_cm,\n    forecast_temp_c: site.forecast_min_temp_c,\n    forecast_window: site.forecast_window,\n    storm_summary: String(b.storm_summary || site.trigger_reason),\n    crew_brief: toHtml(b.crew_brief || site.trigger_reason),\n    client_notice: toHtml(b.client_notice || ('Crews are being dispatched to ' + site.site_name + ' for snow and ice service.')),\n    crew_name: site.crew_name,\n    crew_email: site.crew_email,\n    contact_name: site.contact_name,\n    contact_email: site.contact_email,\n    severity: site.severity,\n    status: 'dispatched',\n    dispatched_at: $now.toISO()\n  } });\n});\nif (!out.length) {\n  evals.forEach(site => {\n    out.push({ json: {\n      dispatch_id: 'DSP-' + site.site_id + '-' + stamp,\n      site_id: site.site_id,\n      site_name: site.site_name,\n      address: site.address,\n      priority: site.priority,\n      trigger_reason: site.trigger_reason,\n      forecast_snow_cm: site.forecast_snow_cm,\n      forecast_temp_c: site.forecast_min_temp_c,\n      forecast_window: site.forecast_window,\n      storm_summary: site.trigger_reason,\n      crew_brief: 'Call the crew and clear ' + site.site_name + '. Reason: ' + site.trigger_reason + '. Plow and salt as needed and report back when the site is clear.',\n      client_notice: 'Crews are being dispatched to ' + site.site_name + ' for snow and ice service tonight.',\n      crew_name: site.crew_name,\n      crew_email: site.crew_email,\n      contact_name: site.contact_name,\n      contact_email: site.contact_email,\n      severity: site.severity,\n      status: 'dispatched',\n      dispatched_at: $now.toISO()\n    } });\n  });\n}\nreturn out;\n"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"log-dispatch","name":"Log Dispatch","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[2640,-768],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{"notes":"={{ '' }}","status":"={{ $json.status }}","address":"={{ $json.address }}","site_id":"={{ $json.site_id }}","priority":"={{ $json.priority }}","crew_name":"={{ $json.crew_name }}","salt_used":"={{ '' }}","site_name":"={{ $json.site_name }}","crew_brief":"={{ $json.crew_brief }}","crew_email":"={{ $json.crew_email }}","dispatch_id":"={{ $json.dispatch_id }}","completed_at":"={{ '' }}","contact_name":"={{ $json.contact_name }}","client_notice":"={{ $json.client_notice }}","contact_email":"={{ $json.contact_email }}","dispatched_at":"={{ $json.dispatched_at }}","storm_summary":"={{ $json.storm_summary }}","hours_to_clear":"={{ '' }}","trigger_reason":"={{ $json.trigger_reason }}","forecast_temp_c":"={{ $json.forecast_temp_c }}","forecast_window":"={{ $json.forecast_window }}","forecast_snow_cm":"={{ $json.forecast_snow_cm }}"},"schema":[{"id":"dispatch_id","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"dispatch_id","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"site_id","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"site_id","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"site_name","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"site_name","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"address","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"address","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"priority","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"priority","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"trigger_reason","type":"string","display":true,"removed":false,"required":false,"displayName":"trigger_reason","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"forecast_snow_cm","type"